      {
        "uuid": "75453e66-1a19-5dc2-aaf1-400aecebd8b1",
        "title": "ac-2 determination",
        "description": "Examined the 2026-09-12 quarterly account review record and interviewed the ISSO: the 3 administrator and 2 auditor identity-service accounts match approved access requests, the break-glass account esgadmin is sealed and unused since 2026-06, and DT-2 showed users without an approved group claim were refused. However, the shared local account fieldtech is used by 10 field technicians, its use cannot be attributed to an individual, and its password is changed every 90 days rather than when a technician leaves the team, so account management does not meet the control's intent for that account.",
