      {
        "uuid": "02b84984-5491-5fed-ba38-5d112165d5e7",
        "title": "ia-2 determination",
        "description": "DT-2 results and the developer interview show remote administrators and auditors are uniquely identified and authenticated with DoD PKI at the Installation ICAM Service, their console sessions carry the individual's identity, users without an approved group claim were refused, and local lockout and session lock passed; the identity service's part is covered by the Installation Network Enclave ATO (2025-11-20). However, the open STIG finding STG-004 confirms the 10 field technicians sign in on the maintenance port with the shared local account fieldtech, so those users are not uniquely identified and their sessions cannot be associated with a person (IA-02[01], IA-02[02] not met for that path).",
