      {
        "uuid": "162435c7-021a-56c4-ac6f-f61f67fbefb4",
        "title": "si-2 determination",
        "description": "Flaws are identified and reported through developer tracking and vulnerability scans, corrected in a signed monthly bundle tested on reference units before release, and each bundle passes the configuration control board (SI-02a, SI-02b, SI-02d met, per the developer interview and the update architecture). SI-02c is not met: the 2026-09-30 vulnerability scan showed esg-north-01 and esg-ridge-01 running the 2026-07 bundle, 63 days old against the 30-day period, with 4 high and 9 medium vulnerabilities fixed in later bundles, and STIG finding STG-001 (BM-01, CAT II) is open; 10 of 12 units were current with no vulnerabilities.",
