    "findings": [
      {
        "uuid": "3ac9a506-174b-5dc6-b505-5348d291e126",
        "title": "Shared field-technician account fieldtech is not attributable and not managed on team departure",
        "description": "AC-2 requires accounts to be managed so that use is authorized and monitored and authenticators change when group membership changes. The 2026-09-12 account review and the ISSO interview show that the shared local account fieldtech is used by 10 field technicians, its sign-ins cannot be attributed to a person, and its password changes every 90 days instead of when a technician leaves the team. The program plans per-technician accounts with smart-card login in release 2.3 (2027-03).",
