        "remarks": "Deliver per-technician local accounts with smart-card login (release 2.3); until then, change the fieldtech password whenever a technician leaves the team and keep a site-visit sign-in log that ties each fieldtech session to a named technician."
      },
      {
        "uuid": "57f27968-657c-55e3-bf76-59078136800e",
        "title": "Field technicians share the local account fieldtech and are not uniquely identified",
        "description": "IA-2 requires organizational users to be uniquely identified and authenticated and that identity to be associated with processes acting for them. The witnessed 2026-09-30 scan left STG-004 (BM-03, CAT II, INV-004: application permits shared accounts for privileged access) open, and the developer confirmed that all 10 field technicians sign in on the maintenance port as fieldtech, so maintenance-port sessions cannot be tied to an individual. Release 2.3 (planned 2027-03) adds per-technician accounts with smart-card login; nothing has changed on fielded units.",
